+## Latest Runtime-A candidate — 2026-10-04
+
+The verified published updater manifest is Surveyor 0.3.57, but its official chunked ZIP contains probe 0.3.35. The separate 0.3.57 source ZIP previously used for development had probe 0.3.36 and did not match the published ZIP hash. Use the official 0.3.57 package as the true integration base.
+
