+The 0.3.37 source candidate is not published as a Surveyor update. Main integration must build a canonical 0.3.58 full package, update package chunks and updater manifest together, and validate updater refresh/rollback. Live NMS validation needs one short root event after release, not a full traversal.
+
+
 ## Current state
 
